    "notes": [
      {
        "source": "chiuinan",
        "text": "1.鄜：音肤。"
      },
      {
        "source": "chiuinan",
        "text": "2.云鬟：指秀发如云。鬟，音环。"
      },
      {
        "source": "chiuinan",
        "text": "3.清辉：月光。"
      },
      {
        "source": "chiuinan",
        "text": "3.虚幌：素色轻纱所做的帏幔。幌，音晃，帏幔。"
      }
